0.0000 Tw
(                              Absolute Minimum:  0.5 mL serum</pre>  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(         Rejection Criteria:  Severely lipemic, or hemolyzed specimens.  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(             Reference Range  < or = 0.02 nmol/L  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Order Form:  A-1a Miscellaneous Request or Epic Req  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  Myasthenia gravis \(MG\) is characterized by weakness and easy ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              fatigability that are relieved by rest and anticholinesterase drugs. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              The weakness in most cases results from an autoantibody-mediated loss ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              of functional acetylcholine receptors in the postsynaptic membrane of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              skeletal muscle.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Demonstration of muscle AChR autoantibodies in a patient's serum ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              supports the diagnosis of acquired \(autoimmune\) MG, and quantitation ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              provides a baseline for future comparisons.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Muscle AChR antibodies are not found in congenital forms of MG and are ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              uncommon in neurologic conditions other than acquired MG, with the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              exception of patients with paraneoplastic autoimmune neurological ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              disorders, and Lambert-Eaton myasthenic syndrome \(LES\) with or without ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              cancer \(13% of LES patients have positive results for muscle AChR ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              binding or striational antibodies\). Patients with autoimmune liver ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              disease are also frequently seropositive.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              The assay for muscle AChR binding antibodies is considered a first- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              order test for the laboratory diagnosis of MG, and for ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              detecting "subclinical MG" in recipients of D-penicillamine, in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 251.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              patients with thymoma without clinical evidence of MG, and in patients ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              with graft-versus-host disease. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 222.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Methodology  Radioimmunoassay \(RIA\)  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 213.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(               Analytic Time  6 days upon receipt at reference laboratory  ) Tj
