0.0000 Tw
(                              *Puberty onset \(transition from Tanner stage I to Tanner stage II\) ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              occurs for boys at a median age of 11.5 \(+/-2\) years and for girls at a ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              median age of 10.5 \(+/-2\) years. There is evidence that it may occur up ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              to 1 year earlier in obese girls and in African American girls. For ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              boys, there is no proven relationship between puberty onset and body ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              weight or ethnic origin. Progression through Tanner stages is variable. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Tanner stage V \(adult\) should be reached by age 18.   ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
