0.0000 Tw
(                              to 7/7/10, the new assay has very good cross-reactivity for MDMA ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(Ecstasy\) and other designer amphetamines \(MDA, MBDB, MDEA\).  The older ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              assay did not cross-react well with amphetamines other than amphetamine ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              and methamphetamine. The new assay has low cross-reactivity with non- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              amphetamine drugs \(ephedrine, pseudoephedrine, phentermine, etc.\). ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 251.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Patients on labetalol can have a false positive amphetamines screen due ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              to a metabolite of labetalol structurally resembling amphetamine. In ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 232.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              these cases, confirmatory testing will be negative. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 213.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              References: ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 194.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Belson MG, Simon HK, Sullivan K, Geller RJ.  The Utility of Toxicologic ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 184.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Analysis in Children with Suspected Ingestion.  Pediatr Emerg Care ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 174.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              1999;15:383-387. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 155.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Bast RP, Helmer SD, Henderson SR, Rogers MA, Shapiro WM, Smith RS. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 146.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Limited Utility of Routine Drug Screening in Trauma Patients.  South ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 136.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Med J 2000;93:397-399. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 117.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Hammett-Stabler CA, Pesce AJ, Cannon DJ.  Urine Drug Screening in the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 107.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Medical Setting.  Clinica Chimica Acta 2002;315:125-135. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 88.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Schiller MJ, Shumway M, Batki SL.  Utility of Routine Drug Screening in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 78.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              a Psychiatric Emergency Setting.  Psychiatric Services 2000;51:474-478. ) Tj
