1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              bereported. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Patients with an index of &#8805; 0.5 are considered to be positive ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              for galactomannan antigen. ) Tj
