1 0 0 1 102.0 750.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Order Form:  A-1a Clinical Microbiology Laboratory or Epic Req  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 741.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  <pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 731.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Gram stains are automatically performed on fluids and exudates other ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 722.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              than blood and urine.  Do not send sterile body fluids in plastic red ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 712.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              top tubes.  These tubes contain a clot activator which may make testing ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 702.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              unreliable. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 683.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Label transport tube with two patient identifiers, date and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 674.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              time of collection. Transport at room temperature unless otherwise ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 664.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              specified. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 654.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              A. <u>Abscess</u> - Tissue or aspirates are always superior to swab ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 645.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                 specimens.  Remove surface exudate by wiping with sterile saline or ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 635.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                 70% alcohol.  Aspirate with needle and syringe. Cleanse rubber ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 626.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                 stopper of anaerobic transport vial \(59546\) with alcohol; allow to ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                 dry 1 min before inoculating; push needle through septum and inject ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                 all abscess material on top of agar. If a swab must be used, pass ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                 the swab deep into the base of the lesion to firmly sample the fresh ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                 border. Transport time &#8804;2 hours. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              B. <u>Anaerobic cultures</u> - Tissue or aspirates are preferred rather ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                 than swabs. Fluid collections should be aspirated through  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              disinfected ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                 tissue or skin. For superficial ulcers, collect material from below ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                 the surface \(after surface debridement or use a needle and syringe\). ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                 Submit specimens using anaerobic transport media: ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                 a. Anaerobic transport vial \(fluid specimen, 59546\): Cleanse rubber ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    stopper with alcohol; allow to dry 1 min before inoculation; push ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    needle through septum and inject specimen on top of agar. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                 b. Anaerobic jar \(tissue specimen, 59547\). Place sample on top of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    agar.  Keep jar upright to maintain atmosphere in jar. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                 c. A sterile container \(37778\) may be used for tissue if transported ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    to the microbiology lab immediately \(add drops of sterile saline ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    to keep small pieces of tissue moist\). ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                 d. Copan Liquid Amies Elution Swab \(ESwab\) \(745421\) - swab specimens ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    are suboptimal, but will be accepted if no other sample can be ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    obtained. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                 e. Deliver all specimens to the laboratory immediately after ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    collection. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                 f. Anaerobic flora is prevalent on mucosal surfaces of the oral ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    cavity, upper respiratory, gastrointestinal, and genital tracts; ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    specimens collected from these sites should not ordinarily be ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    cultured for anaerobic bacteria. The following is a list of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    specimens that are likely to be contaminated with anaerobic ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    normal flora and are NOT routinely accepted for anaerobic  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              culture. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    1\) Throat or nasopharyngeal swabs ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    2\) Gingival or other intraoral surface swabs ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    3\) Expectorated sputum ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    4\) Sputum obtained by nasotracheal or endotracheal suction ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    5\) Bronchial washings ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    6\) Voided or catheterized urine ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    7\) Vaginal or cervical swabs ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 251.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    8\) Gastric and small bowel contents \(except for "blind loop" or ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                       bacterial overgrowth syndrome\) ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 232.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    9\) Feces \(except for specific etiologic agents such as ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 222.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                       <em>C. difficile</em> and <em>C. botulinum</em>\) ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 213.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                   10\) Rectal swabs-Surface swabs from ulcers and wounds\(collect ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 203.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                       material from below the surface\) ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 194.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                   11\) Material adjacent to a mucous membrane that has not been ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 184.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                       adequately decontaminated ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 165.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              C. <u>Blood</u> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 155.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                 a. <u>Adult</u> - Cleanse oil or visible dirt from site with alcohol ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 146.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    pads before using ChloraPrep skin prep. Cleanse skin with ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 136.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    ChloraPrep&#174; one-step 1.5 mL Frepp&reg; ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 126.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    1\) Holding the applicator sponge downward, pinch wings on ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 117.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                       applicator to break ampule and release the antiseptic. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 107.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    2\) Use a side-to-side motion to scrub the site with the friction ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 98.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                       pad for a full 30 sec; allow site to dry completely \(at least ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 88.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                       30 sec\) before venipuncture. Do not touch site after prep. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 78.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                    3\) Remove overcaps from bottles \(1 aerobic 924171 and 1 anaerobic ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 69.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                       924172\) and cleanse each rubber septum with separate 70% ) Tj
/F21 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 37 Tm
(Updated:Mon Aug 26 14:13:27 2013) Tj
1 0 0 1 511.88 37 Tm
(75) Tj
