1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              "Bath salts" are a term used to describe amphetamine-like compounds ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              that are abused and which share physiologic effects similar to ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              amphetamine, methamphetamine, and MDMA/Ecstasy.  This assay detects the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              three most common compounds that are distributed illicitly as bath ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              salts \(MDPV, mephedrone, and methylone\).  Compounds other than MDPV, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              mephedrone and methylone will not be detected.  It should be kept in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              mind that there are large number of amphetamine-like compounds whose ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              synthesis has been described and which could appear as drugs of abuse. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
