0.0000 Tw
(         Rejection Criteria:  <strong class="style_red">Sample MUST be received by laboratory within ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              48 hours of collection due to lability of RNA.</strong>  ) Tj
