1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  Serial analysis of BCR-ABL mRNA levels by real-time quantitative ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              polymerase chain reaction \(QRT-PCR\) during and/or after therapy ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(imatinib, dasatinib, nilotinib, or stem cell transplantation\) ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              accurately reflects the levels of disease suppression and is an ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              effective method for monitoring treatment efficacy.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Major Molecular Response \(MMR\) reflects a patient's response to CML ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              treatment and MMR is defined as greater than or equal to a 3-log ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              reduction in BCR-ABL/control gene ratio from a standardized median ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              baseline value.  In the International Randomized Interferon versus ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              STI571 \(IRIS\) study, patients with a ratio at or below MMR within 18 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              months of starting treatment were 100% free from progressing to ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              accelerated phase or blast crisis at 60 months.  The laboratory employs ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              an MMR reference value that has been validated with the WHO ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              International Standard.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Interassay Variability:  Above MMR: less than 2-fold, Below MMR: less ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              than 4-fold<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Sensitivity:  One tumor cell in 1 x 10<sup>4</sup> normal cells<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Limit of Quantitation:  30 BCR-ABL copies<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              The laboratory reports the BCR-ABL/ABL raw ratio, the percent ratio ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              standardized to the International Standard \(%IS\), the BCR-ABL copy ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              number, and the ABL copy number as separate values that can be trended ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              using Epic graph function.  Breakpoint determination will be performed ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              and reported for new diagnosis specimens only. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                See Appendix  See Additional Information: <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
