1 0 0 1 102.0 640.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  <pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 630.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Please send a Surgical Pathology H-1 form to Immunopathology with this ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 621.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              request. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 602.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              C-erb-2 oncoprotein is the product of the HER-2 \(neu\) oncogene which is ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 592.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              overexpressed in a variety of adenocarcinomas arising at various sites. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 582.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Overexpression of c-erb-2 is present in 15-30% of cases of breast ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 573.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              carcinoma and has been demonstrated to be a negative prognostic ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 563.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              indicator. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 544.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              C-erb-2 overexpression can be detected by immunohistochemical staining ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 534.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              of formalin-fixed paraffin-embedded sections of tumor tissue. Membrane ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 525.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              staining of the cells is the only reaction considered positive. A ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 515.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              positive therapeutic response to Herceptin \(TM\) therapy with ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 506.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              anti-C-erb-2 monoclonal antibody has been reported in association with ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 496.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              3+ staining intensity.</pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 477.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
