0.0000 Tw
(                              Cyclin-dependent kinase-like 5 \(CDKL5 or STK9\) has been associated with ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              an atypical variant of Rett syndrome, with severe early-onset seizures ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              or infantile spasms, loss of communication and motor skills, and severe ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
