(                     Minimum  3 mL of peripheral blood. Specimens for which the AML blast count is at ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 654.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              least 20% will be tested. Testing on specimens with a lower blast count ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 645.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              may be attempted with approval of lab director. However, such testing ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 635.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              is not recommended due to the increased possibility of a false-negative ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 626.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              result.  ) Tj
