1 0 0 1 102.0 635.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  <u>Useful For</u>:<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 626.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Detection of <em>Chlamydia trachomatis</em><br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <u>Cautions</u>:<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              This report is intended for use in clinical monitoring or management of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              patients; it is not intended for use in medico-legal applications.<br  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Appropriate specimen collection and handling is necessary for optimal ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              assay performance.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Results should be interpreted in conjunction with other laboratory and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              clinical information.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              A negative test result does not exclude the possibility of infection. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Improper specimen collection, concurrent antibiotic therapy, presence ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              of inhibitors, or low numbers of organisms in the specimen \(ie, below ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              the sensitivity of the test\) may cause false-negative test ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              results.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              In low-prevalence populations, positive results must be interpreted ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              carefully as false-positive results may occur more frequently than  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              true- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              positive results in this setting.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              In general, this assay should not be used to assess therapeutic success ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              or failure, since nucleic acids from these organisms may persist for 3 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              weeks or more following antimicrobial therapy.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              The presence of mucous does not interfere with this assay. However, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              this test requires endocervical cells, and if excess mucous is not ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              removed prior to collection, adequate numbers of these cells may not be ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              obtained.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              No interference is expected with swab specimens due to:<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              -Blood<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              -Lubricants and spermicides<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              The effects of use of tampons, douching, specimen types other than ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              those listed in Specimen Required, and specimen collection variables ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 251.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              have not been determined.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 232.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              This assay <strong>does not</strong> detect <em>Chlamydia ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 222.8 Tm
