1 0 0 1 102.0 731.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              SPECIMEN IN ALCOHOL OR FORMALIN OR FREEZE.  Label tube with patient ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 722.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              name and medical record number.  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 712.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(             Reference Range  Male: 46,XY     Female: 46,XX  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 702.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Order Form:  C-12 Cytogenetics Request or Epic Req  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 693.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  Specimen should be collected as soon as possible. In the case of a ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 683.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              recently deceased infant \(< 24 hours\) a blood specimen from a cardiac ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 674.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              puncture usually gives a good result. Skin and other tissues obtained ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 664.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              more than 48 hours post-mortem have a markedly decreased success rate ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 654.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              of cell growth for cytogenetic analysis.<pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 635.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                               I. Peripheral blood: ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 626.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                  -Collect 5-10 cc adult, 2 cc infants of blood in a green-top ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                   vacutainer with sodium heparin. Invert tube to mix well.  DO NOT ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                   FREEZE OR CENTRIFUGE. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                  -Deliver specimen to the Cytogenetics Lab \(W-101, GH\) as soon as ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                   possible during work hours \(Monday through Friday, 0800-1700\). ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              II. Skin, fetal tissue, diaphragm tissue, tumor tissue, other tissue: ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                  -Call the Cytogenetics lab for specimen transport tubes with ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                   media.  If special transport media is not available, sterile ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                   Ringers lactate solution can be used. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                  -Specimen should be obtained aseptically. Do not put specimen in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                   alcohol or formalin. Do not freeze or flame or refrigerate. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                  -In cases of abortion, don't send intact fetus.  Send only tissue ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                   specimen to the lab \(skin, diaphragm, lung, etc\). ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              -Label the tube\(s\) with patient name and medical record number \(there ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                               should be two identifications\). ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              -Specimens should be sent at room temperature. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Also call the lab at 319-356-3877 with any questions.</pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /><a ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              href="http://www.medicine.uiowa.edu/pediatrics/cytogenetics/">Shivanand ) Tj
