0.0000 Tw
(                                 deletion or duplication, and identify the number of genes involved ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                 For 'apparently balanced' rearrangements and an abnormal clinical ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                 phenotype, CMA can be used to test for cryptic deletions/ ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                 duplications at the breakpoints or at other regions ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              </pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /><br /><a ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              href="http://www.medicine.uiowa.edu/pediatrics/cytogenetics/">Shivanand ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              R. Patil Cytogenetics & Molecular Laboratory Website</a>  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Methodology  DNA isolated from peripheral blood is hybridized to an Affymetrix array ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              containing oligonucleotide probes across the genome to detect copy ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              number imbalances.  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(               Analytic Time  Final results within 30 days  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(            Testing Schedule  <pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Specimens are accepted Monday - Friday, 0800-1700.  Provide details of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              clinical information.  If the specimen is collected over the weekend, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              please page the technologist on call by dialing 1-888-533-0186.  When  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              it stops ringing, enter your phone number, the '#' sign, and hang  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              up.</pre>  ) Tj
