0.0000 Tw
(             Reference Range  0-3 months: 0.8-2.3 mg/L<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 626.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              4-11 months: 0.7-1.5 mg/L<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              1-17 years: 0.5-1.3 mg/L<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              18 years and older: 0.5-1.0 mg/L  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Order Form:  A-1a General Lab or Epic Req  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  Cystatin C is produced by all nucleated cells at a constant rate and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              the production rate in humans is remarkably constant over the entire ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              lifetime. Elimination from the circulation is almost entirely via ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              glomerular filtration. For this reason the serum concentration of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              cystatin C is independent from muscle mass and gender in the age range ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              1 to 50 years. Therefore cystatin C in plasma and serum has been ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              proposed as a more sensitive marker for GFR, and several studies, as ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              well as one meta analysis, have suggested that cystatin C is superior ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              to serum creatinine for estimation of GFR. Patient groups which benefit ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              most are those with mild to moderate kidney disease and also those in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              acute renal failure, where toxic drugs have to be administered which ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              are excreted by glomerular filtration, especially elder people \(> 50 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              years\), children, pregnant women with suspicion of pre-eclampsia, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              diabetics, people with diseases of skeletal muscle and renal transplant ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              recipients. Additionally cystatin C has been discussed in recent ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              literature as a prognostic marker for acute heart failure.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <u>References</u>:<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
