(                     Minimum  0.2-0.3 mL \(This amount of sample will perform from 1 up to 4 viral ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 654.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              tests\).  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 645.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(             Reference Range  Negative  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 635.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
