1 0 0 1 102.0 626.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  Useful for rapid qualitative detection of cytomegalovirus \(CMV\) DNA in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              specimens for laboratory diagnosis of disease due to this virus.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <u>Cautions</u>:  A negative result does not eliminate the possibility ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              of cytomegalovirus \(CMV\) infection.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              This assay is only to be used for patients with a clinical history and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              symptoms consistent with CMV infection, and must be interpreted in the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              context of the clinical picture. This test should not be used to screen ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              asymptomatic patients. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
