( ) Tj
/F10 8 Tf
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                  Laboratory  Commercial Mail-out Laboratory  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                  Order Code  CMVGAVID  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    CPT Code  86644\(x2\)  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                     Minimum  <pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Preferred Minimum:  0.5 mL serum ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Absolute Minimum:  0.25 mL serum</pre>  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(             Reference Range  >= 0.60  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Order Form:  A-1a Miscellaneous Request or Epic Req  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  <pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Discrimination between recent \(primary\) and past cytomegalovirus \(CMV\) ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              infection can be an important tool in the clinical management of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              transplant recipients and pregnant women. Although nearly all ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              individuals with recent CMV infection are positive for CMV IgM, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              individuals with past CMV may also express CMV IgM following viral ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              reactivation; thus, detection of CMV IgM is not a reliable indicator of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              recent infection. Measurement of CMV IgG avidity can assist in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              discriminating recent from past CMV infection. Although a low avidity ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              index is a reliable indicator of CMV infection within the previous 6 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              months, a high avidity index is more meaningful from a clinical ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              standpoint; a high avidity index essentially excludes the possibility ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              that infection occurred within the previous 4 months. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              In summary, assessment of CMV-specific IgG avidity is an extremely ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 232.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              powerful tool for estimating the time of CMV infection. Such ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 222.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              information is particularly important in the clinical management of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 213.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              pregnant women found to be positive for CMV antibodies at their first ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 203.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              prenatal visit. Determining the time of primary infection can help ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 194.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              guide decisions regarding antiviral therapy by identifying those women ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 184.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              who should or should not be treated during pregnancy. CMV IgG avidity ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 174.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              measurement also has broad applicability to the management of other ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 165.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              patient groups with an increased risk of debilitating CMV disease, such ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 155.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              as solid organ transplant recipients.  Approximately 50% of pregnant ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 146.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              women with primary CMV infection transmit CMV to their infants. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 136.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Measuring CMV IgG avidity can reliably distinguish primary infection ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 126.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              from active latent infection during pregnancy. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 107.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              See reference laboratory's <a href=" http://www.focusdx.com/techsheets/CMVIgGAvidity.pdf">information</a> on this test.</pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 88.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Methodology  Enzyme Linked Immunosorbent Assay \(ELISA\)  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 78.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(               Analytic Time  5 days upon receipt at reference laboratory  ) Tj
/F21 10 Tf
