(                              Screen includes amphetamines, benzodiazepines, cocaine, opiates, and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              oxycodone/oxymorphone. A presumptive positive result for any of the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              tested drugs indicates the possible presence of the drug or metabolites ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              in the urine, but does not measure the level of intoxication. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              If confirmation is needed for amphetamines, benzodiazepines, cocaine, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              opiates, or oxycodone/oxymorphone, call the Laboratory at 356-3527. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Allow up to seven days for confirmatory results. Confirmation is at an ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              additional charge. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              The drug of abuse-urine panel was changed April 12, 2010 by the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              addition of the oxycodone screen and no longer including a screen for ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              THC. If testing for THC is desired, see "THC, Urine Screen" or "THC, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Urine Screen + Reflex Confirmation. The drug of abuse panel was further ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              changed August 30, 2010 by no longer including a screen for ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              barbiturates.  If testing for barbiturates is desired, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              see "Barbiturates, Urine Screen".  The individual components of the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              drug of abuse-urine screen can also be ordered individually, if desired ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(see links at end\). ) Tj
