(                              transmission.  The oxycodone screen is based on the competition between ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 746.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              a drug labeled with glucose-6-phosphate dehydrogenase \(G6PDH\), and free ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 734.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              drug from the urine sample for a fixed amount of specific antibody ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 722.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              binding sites.  In the absence of free drug from the sample, the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 710.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              specific antibody binds the drug labeled with G6PDH and causes a ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 698.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              decrease in enzyme activity.  This phenomenon creates a direct ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 686.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              relationship between the drug concentration in urine and enzyme ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 674.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              activity.  The enzyme activity is determined spectrophotometrically at ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 662.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              340 nm by measuring the conversion of nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 650.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(NAD\) to NADH.  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 638.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(               Analytic Time  1 hour \(upon receipt in laboratory\)  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 626.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(            Testing Schedule  24 hrs/day, 7 days a week, including holidays.  ) Tj
/F21 10 Tf
