(                              Screen includes amphetamines, benzodiazepines, cocaine, opiates, and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              oxycodone/oxymorphone. A presumptive positive result for any of the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              tested drugs indicates the possible presence of the drug or metabolites ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              in the urine, but does not measure the level of intoxication. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Confirmation is automatically sent to a commercial laboratory for ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              amphetamines, cocaine, opiates, and oxycodone/oxymorphone, except for ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              patients in the ETC.  Confirmation for benzodiazepines and opiates and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              oxycodone/oxymorphone is also NOT automatic for any inpatient units due ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              to the high prevalence of use of benzodiazepines and opiates in the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              inpatient and ETC setting. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Confirmation of any test is accomplished by the ordering physician ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              calling Specimen Control at 356-3527, upon receipt of a positive ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              screening result. The samples are maintained in the laboratory frozen ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              for 30 days post screening. The drug of abuse-urine panel was changed ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              April 12, 2010 by the addition of the oxycodone screen and no longer ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              including a screen for THC. If testing for THC is desired, see "THC, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Urine Screen" or "THC, Urine Screen + Reflex Confirmation". The drug of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              abuse panel was further changed August 30, 2010 by no longer including ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              a screen for barbiturates.  If testing for barbiturates is desired, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              see "Barbiturates, Urine Screen".  The individual components of the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              drug of abuse-urine screen can also be ordered individually, if desired ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(see links at end\). ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Confirmation is at an additional charge. ) Tj
