0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  The Xpert EV Assay is designed to detect enterovirus \(EV\) RNA ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(enterovirus genome 5' untranslated region between nucleotide 452 and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              596\) in CSF samples. The assay detects most enteroviruses, including ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              echoviruses, coxsackie A viruses, and coxsackie B viruses. The assay ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              does not distinguish between serotypes.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Results from the Xpert EV assay should be interpreted in conjunction ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              with other laboratory and clinical data. Positive enterovirus PCR ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              results do not rule out other causes of meningitis, including bacteria, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              mycobacteria, other viruses \(herpes family viruses, arboviruses, mumps ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              virus, etc\) and fungi. Rare occurrences of simultaneous mixed  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              bacterial- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              viral meningitis have been reported in the literature.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              This test is only performed on CSF. For detection of enteroviruses in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              blood, order <a href=http://www.healthcare.uiowa.edu/path_handbook/handbook/test2698.html> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Enterovirus Detection by RTPCR</a> . ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                See Appendix  See Additional Information: <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
