1 0 0 1 102.0 693.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  <pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 683.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Please send a Surgical Pathology H-1 form to Immunopathology with this ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 674.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              request. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 654.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              If ER studies are desired on previous surgical material, please send a ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 645.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              requisition to Immunopathology, 5238 RCP.  Provide the patient's name, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 635.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              hospital number and surgical pathology specimen number. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Estrogen Receptor \(ER\) expression status in breast carcinoma is an ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              important prognostic and predictive biomarker according to recently ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              published guidelines. ER status determination has become a part of the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              routine assessment of these tumors. About 60-70% of these tumors are ER ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              positive, and this is associated with a more favorable prognosis than ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              ER negative tumors. Immunohistochemical assessment of ER \(as well as ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              progesterone receptor\) status has been recently documented to be ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              superior to ligand binding assays in predicting response to hormonal ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              manipulation in breast carcinoma. Immunohistochemical staining is ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              performed on formalin-fixed, paraffin-embedded sections of tumor. An ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              immunohistochemical \(IHC\) score is generated by the interpreting ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              pathologist. A score of >2 has been used to define ER positivity.</pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                        See:  <br />Progesterone Receptor, Tissue or FNA  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Methodology  Immunohistochemistry  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
