(                              lavender top \(EDTA\) microtubes for pediatric patients.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 635.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 626.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Absolute Minimum:  0.3 mL whole blood in lavender \(EDTA\) tube or ONE ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              lavender top \(EDTA\) microtube for pediatric patients.  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
