1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Order Form:  A-1a Therapeutic Drug Analysis or Epic Req  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  Everolimus \(Zortress&#174;, Certican&#174;, Afinitor&#174;\) whole blood ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              concentrations can be measured by either chromatographic or immunoassay ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              methodologies.  These two methodologies are not directly ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              interchangeable, and the measured everolimus whole blood concentration ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              depends upon the type of assay used.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Sirolimus \(rapamycin\) cross-reacts significantly with the everolimus ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              immunoassay. Everolimus blood concentrations cannot be determined ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              reliably in patients whose blood has both sirolimus and everolimus. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              This can occur when patients are being transitioned from sirolimus to ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              everolimus or everolimus to sirolimus.  In transitioning patients from ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              sirolimus to everolimus, the long therapeutic half-life of sirolimus ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(~2-3 days\) should be kept in mind. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
