(                    Comments  Testing should not be performed with actively bleeding hemorrhoids or ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              during menstruation. It is strongly recommended not to use stool ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
