(                              *Possible localization of occult neoplasms causing oncogenic<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 746.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              &nbsp;osteomalacia<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 734.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              *Diagnosing X-linked hypophosphatemia or autosomal dominant<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 722.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              &nbsp;hypophosphatemic rickets<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 710.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              *Diagnosing familial tumoral calcinosis with hyperphosphatemia<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 698.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              *Predicting treatment response to calcitriol or vitamin D analogs<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 686.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              &nbsp;in patients with renal failure<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 674.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 662.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <strong><u>Cautions</u>:</strong><br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 650.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              FGF23 levels must always be interpreted in conjunction with serum ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 638.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              phosphate measurements, as FGF23 will be elevated in most other ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 626.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              conditions that cause hyperphosphatemia in vivo. These include: renal ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 614.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              failure, severe catabolic states \(eg, severe systemic illness, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 602.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              uncontrolled type I diabetes mellitus, severe starvation\), vitamin D ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 590.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              toxicity, intravenous phosphate treatment and very high phosphate diets ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(eg, diets based largely on processed meats, processed cheese or other ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 566.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              dairy products\), advanced malignancy \(particular with tumor lysis\), ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 554.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              crush or other significant muscle injury or destruction, fractures, and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 542.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              some endocrine disorders, in particular hypoparathyroidism and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              acromegaly. With the exception of renal failure, FGF23 measurements ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 518.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              will not contribute to diagnosis or patient management in these ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 506.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              situations. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
