(                    Comments  Mutations in the fukutin gene \(FCMD, OMIM #607440\) cause disorders in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              the dystroglycanopathy spectrum, all with autosomal recessive ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              inheritance.  FCMD mutations are known to cause Walker-Warburg syndrome ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              at the severe end of the spectrum, and limb-girdle muscular dystrophy ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              type 2L \(LGMD2L\) at the mild end of the spectrum.  Fukuyama congenital ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              muscular dystrophy is an intermediate phenotype and is the second most ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              common muscular dystrophy among Japanese people. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
