(                     Minimum  Preferred Minimum:  5.0 mL whole blood in a pink top \(EDTA\) tube.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 654.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Absolute Minimum:  2.0 mL whole blood in a pink top \(EDTA\) tube.  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 645.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(         Rejection Criteria:  Specimen cannot be frozen.  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 635.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(             Reference Range  > or = 18.5 U/g of hemoglobin  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 626.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Order Form:  A-1a Miscellaneous Request or Epic Req  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  <pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Patient's age is required on request form for processing. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Useful for: ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              1\) Diagnosis, carrier detection, and determination of genotype of GALT ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              deficiency, the most common case of galactosemia ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              2\) Differentiating D/G mixed heterozygotes from classical galactosemia ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              3\) Confirming results of new born screening programs ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Preferred test to evaluate for possible diagnosis of galactosemia, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              routine carrier screening, and follow-up of abnormal newborn screening ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              results. Comprehensive reflex test begins with quantitative  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              galactose-1- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              phosphate uridyltransferase \(GALT\) enzyme analysis.  If quantitative ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              GALT enzyme value is consistent with a diagnosis of or carrier status ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              for galactosemia, DNA analysis of the <em>GALT</em> gene is performed ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              to detect the 4 most frequently encountered classic galactosemia ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              alleles \(Q188R, S135L, K285N, and L195P\) in addition to the N314D ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(Duarte\) and L218L \(Los Angeles\) variants.</pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                        See:  <br />Galactose-1-Phosphate Uridyltransferase Pheno, Whole Blood  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Methodology  Galactose-1-phosphate uridyltransferase converts uridine ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              diphosphoglucose \(UDPG\) to UDP-galactose. The amount of UDPG consumed ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              is measured by oxidizing UDPG with concomitant generation of NADPH from ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              NADP \(UDPG-dehydrogenase\), which is measured at 340 nm. \(Beutler E, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Baluda MC: Improved method for measuring galactose-1-phosphate uridyl ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              transferase activity of erythrocytes. Clin Chim Acta 1966 March;13 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              [3]:369-379\)<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              A real-time PCR-based assay using the LightCycler detects 6 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              alterations: Q188R, L195P, S135L, K285N, L218L, and N314D. \(Dobrowolski ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              SF, Banas RA, Suzow JG, et al: Analysis of common mutations in the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              galactose-1-phosphate uridyl transferase gene. J Mol Diagn  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              2003;5:42-47\)  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(               Analytic Time  3 days upon receipt at reference laboratory  ) Tj
/F21 10 Tf
