0.0000 Tw
(                 Methodology  Over 97% of the identified mutations at the DFNB1 locus occur in exon 2 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              of GJB2 \(Van Camp, et al 2005\). We have adopted a tiered screening ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              process focusing first on exon 2 of GJB2 and the two GJB6-containing ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              deletions. The finding of two deafness-causing mutations is consistent ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              with the diagnosis of hearing loss at the DFNB1 locus. If one only ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              mutation is found, mutation screening for the splice site mutation in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              exon 1 of GJB2 \(IVS1 + 1 G>A\) is completed. If no deafness-causing ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              mutations are found, the diagnosis of hearing loss at the DFNB1 locus ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              is excluded based on today\222s standards. \(GJB2 mutation screening is ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              performed by amplification of oligonucleotide primers that flank each ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              exon followed by bi-directional sequencing. Screening for the del\(GJB6- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              D13S1830\) and del\(GJB6-D13S1854\) mutations is completed by PCR ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              amplification of oligonucleotide primers flanking and within the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              deletion breakpoints. Products are run on agarose gel and sized to ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              determine presence or absence of a deletion.\)  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
