(             Reference Range  The criteria proposed by the Fourth International Workshop-Conference ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              on Gestational Diabetes Mellitus \(GDM\) defines GDM as present if two or ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              more of the following plasma glucose values are met or exceeded:<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Fasting plasma glucose concentration > 95 mg/dL ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(5.3 mmol/L\)<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;One-hour plasma glucose concentration > 180 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              mg/dL \(10 mmol/L\)<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Two-hour plasma glucose concentration > 155 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              mg/dL \(8.6 mmol/L\)<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Three-hour plasma glucose concentration > 140 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              mg/dL \(7.8 mmol/L\) ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              American Diabetes Association \(ADA\) guidelines define a 2 hr plasma ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              glucose concentration of 200 mg/dL or greater following a 75 gram oral ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              glucose load as one of the criteria for diagnosing diabetes ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              mellitus.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              References: \(1\) Carpenter MW, Coustan DR.  Criteria for screening tests ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
