(                    Comments  <u>Useful For</u>:<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              &#8226;Diagnosis of alpha-thalassemia<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              &#8226;Prenatal diagnosis of deletional alpha-thalassemia<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              &#8226;Carrier screening for individuals from high-risk ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              populations<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <u>Cautions</u>:<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              In addition to disease-related probes, the multiplex ligation-dependent ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              probe amplification technique utilizes probes localized to other ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              chromosomal regions as internal controls. In certain circumstances, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              these control probes may detect other diseases or conditions for which ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              this test was not specifically intended. Results of the control probes ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              are not normally reported. However, in cases where clinically relevant ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              information is identified, the ordering physician will be informed of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              the result and provided with recommendations for any appropriate  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              follow- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              up testing.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Rare polymorphisms exist that could lead to false-negative or false- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              positive results. If results obtained do not match the clinical ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              findings, additional testing should be considered.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              A previous bone marrow transplant from an allogenic donor will ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              interfere with testing.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Test results should be interpreted in the context of clinical findings, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              family history, and other laboratory data. Errors in our interpretation ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              of results may occur if information given is inaccurate or ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              incomplete.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              This assay cannot be performed on chorionic villus specimens.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Non-deletion types of alpha-thalassemia will not be detected by this ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              assay. This test is not useful for diagnosis or confirmation of beta- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              thalassemia or hemoglobinopathies. <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Hemoglobin electrophoresis should usually be done prior to this test to ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              exclude other diagnoses or to identify non deletion types of alpha- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 251.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              thalassemia.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 232.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Please print, complete, and submit the following with the appropriate ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 222.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              signatures and the correct sample type:  <a href="http://www.mayoreferenceservices.org/it-mmfiles/MolGenCongenitalInheritedInfoSheet.pdf">Molecular Genetics - ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 213.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Congenital Inherited Diseases Patient Information Sheet</a> and the <a ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 203.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              href="http://www.mayomedicallaboratories.com/it- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 194.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              mmfiles/InformedConsent.pdf">Informed Consent for DNA Testing</a> from ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 184.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Mayo Medical Laboratories with the A-1a Miscellaneous Request.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 174.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 165.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Blood is sample of choice.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 155.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 146.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              This mailout test requires pathologist approval for orders during ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 136.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              inpatient encounters.  Mailouts staff will not process order without ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 126.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              approval.  The pathologist covering mailouts approval can be reached at ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 117.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              pager #5379.  If approval is given, the name of the pathologist can be ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 107.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              selected in the drop-down menu to the right of the approval warning in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 98.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Epic when ordering the test. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 78.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Methodology  Dosage Analysis by Polymerase Chain Reaction \(PCR\), Multiplex Ligation- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 69.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Dependent Probe Amplification \(MLPA\) and Luminex Technology. \(PCR is ) Tj
