1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              pager #5379.  If approval is given, the name of the pathologist can be ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              selected in the drop-down menu to the right of the approval warning in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Epic when ordering the test.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Please print, complete and submit the <a ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              href="http://www.healthcare.uiowa.edu/labs/morl/SpecialTestingRequisiti ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              o ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              n.pdf">Special Testing Requisition</a> from the Molecular ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Otolaryngology & Renal Research Laboratory, to Specimen ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Control/Mailouts with the specimen and the Epic Requisition. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Methodology  Sheep erythrocytes are used as index cells in this assay. Sheep ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              erythrocytes generally act as non-activators of complement-mediated ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              lysis in human serum. A small number of C3b molecules spontaneously ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              generated through AP tick-over are deposited on the surface of sheep ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              erythrocytes. In normal human serum, factor H binds to C3b molecules ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              through its N-terminal domains and to sheep erythrocytes through its C- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              terminal domains. These interactions result in efficient protection of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              sheep erythrocytes against complement and no lysis is observed \(Dragon- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Durey et al, 2005, J&oacute;zsi et al, 2007\).<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Abnormal hemolytic activity may be seen when serum from patients with ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              aHUS is used in this assay if these patients carry either genetic ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              mutations or acquired risk factors for aHUS such as FH autoantibodies. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              While abnormal hemolytic activity may also be seen with serum from ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              patients with DDD if these patients carry either genetic mutations or ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              acquired factors for DDD such as C3 nephritic factors, hemolysis will ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              be absent when consumption of AP proteins has been extensive and only a ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              small amount of AP proteins remain in the serum.  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
