1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  Current methods for the detection of IgM anti-HBc may not detect all ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              infected individuals.  False negative results may occur due to antibody ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              levels below the detection limit of this assay or if the patient's ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              antibodies do not react with the antigen used in this test.  A reactive ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              anti-HBc IgM result does not exclude co-infection by another hepatitis ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              virus.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              The assay is limited to the detection of IgM anti-HBc in human serum or ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              plasma. It can be used to determine whether a patient has, or has ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              recently had, acute or subclinical hepatitis B infection. Supportive ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              clinical information, including other hepatitis B markers, should also ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              be evaluated. The test cannot determine a patient's immune status to ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 251.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              hepatitis B.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 232.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Samples should not be taken from patients receiving therapy with high ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 222.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              biotin doses \(i.e. > 5 mg/day\) until at least 8 hours following the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 213.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              last biotin administration.  A reactive anti-HBc IgM result does not ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 203.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              exclude co-infection by another hepatitis virus. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 184.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
