1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Human Herpesvirus 6 \(HHV-6\) infects T-lymphocytes, and has been ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              identified as an etiologic agent of exanthema subitum. Rises in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              antibody titers to HHV-6 have been detected during infection with other ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              viruses. In seroepidemiology studies of the prevalence of exposure ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              using serum screening dilutions of 1:10, the detection of IgG antibody ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              in a mid-life population approaches 100%. Due to this high prevalence ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 251.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              of HHV-6 antibody, correlations of single IgG titers with specific ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              diseases are of little clinical value. ) Tj
