0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  <pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              HHV-7 is detectable in a variety of transplant settings, both HSCT and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              solid organ. Direct effects of HHV-7 include fever, rash, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              myelosuppression, encephalitis, and pneumonitis. Potentially more ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              important are the indirect effects HHV-7 has on CMV disease, invasive ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              fungal disease, and allograft dysfunction. Quantitative HHV-7 DNA PCR ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              can be used to document the presence of the virus as well as track the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              course of infection. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              The primers and probes used in this assay are specific for known ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              strains of HHV-7 based on similarity search algorithms. Additionally, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              no cross reactivity was detected when tested against adenoviruses, BKV, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              CMV, EBV, HSV-1, HSV-2, HHV-6 variant A, HHV-6 variant B, HHV-8, JCV, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              parvovirus B19, SV-40, and VZV.</pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Methodology  Quantitative Real-Time PCR  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(               Analytic Time  24 hours upon receipt in reference laboratory.  ) Tj
/F21 10 Tf
