(                     Minimum  2 mL urine  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 645.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(         Rejection Criteria:  Interfering substance: sputolysin and sodium hydroxide.  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 635.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(             Reference Range  <pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 626.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              - None Detected ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              - Results reports as ng/mL in 0.4 - 19 ng/mL range ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              - Results above the limit of detected but below 0.4 mg/mL are reported ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                as Positive, Below the Limit of Quantification ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              - Results above 19 ng/mL are reported as 'Positive, Above the Limited ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
