1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Viral load, performed within the last month, must be at least 500 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              copies/mL. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              This mailout test requires Infectious Disease attending approval. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Mailouts staff will not process order without approval. If approval is ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              given, the name of the Infectious Disease attending can be selected in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              the drop-down menu to the right of the approval warning in Epic when ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              ordering the test. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Effective 2/21/2013, the process for consent and documentation of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              consent for HIV testing will be done when placing an HIV order in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Epic.  There is no longer a need to obtain an "HIV Pre-Test Counseling ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Packet". ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              These changes align with current state law requirements for HIV testing ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              and UI Healthcare Policy, Policy Governing Human Immunodeficiency Virus ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(HIV\) Education, Testing, Reporting and Confidentiality.  The summary ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              of consent requirements are as follows: ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              &#8226; <u>For adults \(18 years or older\) able to consent</u>: verbal ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                consent must be obtained prior to testing.  Written consent ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                is not necessary for adult patients. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              &#8226; <u>For minors \(less than 18 years old\)</u>: Before undergoing ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                HIV test, a minor must be informed that the legal guardian ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                will be notified if the result is confirmed as positive. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                Minors must give written consent for HIV testing and treatment ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                services.  The consent form must note that that the legal guardian ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                will be notified of confirmed positive results. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              &#8226; <u>For adults or minors unable to consent</u>: The individual's ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                guardian may give consent.  If the legal guardian cannot be ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                located or is unavailable, a health care provider may ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                authorize an HIV test when the test is necessary for diagnostic ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                purposes to provide appropriate urgent medical care. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              HIV orders in minors will all receive retrospective audit review to ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 232.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              make sure proper written consent has been obtained and is scanned into ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 222.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              the patient chart in Epic. ) Tj
