1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              The HIV-1 Proviral DNA PCR assay is a highly specific and sensitive ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              method used to detect the integrated \(proviral\) form of HIV-1 DNA in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              clinical specimens.  This testing can be used for neonatal and infant ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              diagnoses. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              This mailout test requires Infectious Disease attending approval. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
