(                              Diagnostic Algorithm Technology to improve the predictive accuracy. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 203.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Genetic susceptibility influences immune responses and this assay ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 194.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              includes evaluation of ATG16L1, STAT3, NKX2-3, and ECM1.  Inflammatory ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 184.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
