(                              offer assay values, the reference laboratory provides added clarity in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 165.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              diagnosing IBD, UC, and CD.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 155.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
