(                 Order Form:  A-1a Miscellaneous Request or Epic Req  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  Insulin-like growth factor I \(IGF-I, or somatomedin C\), a protein ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              involved in stimulating somatic growth, is regulated principally by ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              growth hormone \(GH\) and nutritional intake. IGF-I is transported in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              serum by several proteins; this helps maintain relatively high IGF-I ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              plasma levels and minimizes fluctuations in serum IGF-I ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              concentrations.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 251.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Measuring IGF-I is useful in several growth-related disorders. Dwarfism ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 232.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              caused by deficiency of growth hormone \(hypopituitarism\) results in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 222.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              decreased serum levels of IGF-I, while acromegaly \(growth hormone ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 213.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              excess\) results in elevated levels of IGF-I. IGF-I measurements are ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 203.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              also helpful in assessing nutritional status; levels are reduced ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 194.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              in undernutrition and restored with a proper diet. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 174.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                        See:  <br />Insulin Like Growth Factor Binding Protein I \(IGFBP-1\), Serum ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 165.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br />Insulin Like Growth Factor Binding Protein III \(IGFBP-3\), Serum ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 155.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br />Insulin-Like Growth Factor II, Serum  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 146.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Methodology  Liquid Chromatography Mass Spectrometry \(LC/MS\)  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 136.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(               Analytic Time  8 working days upon receipt at reference laboratory  ) Tj
