(JC Virus \(Polyomavirus\) by PCR) Tj
/F00 8 Tf
0.0000 Tw
( ) Tj
/F10 8 Tf
1 0 0 1 102.0 760.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                  Laboratory  Commercial Mail-out Laboratory  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 750.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                  Order Code  JCVPCR  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 741.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    CPT Code  87798  ) Tj
