(                              </tr> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 674.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              </table> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 654.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                     Minimum  <pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 645.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Spinal Fluid \(For Detection of JC Virus Only\) ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 635.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              0.5 mL of spinal fluid.</pre>  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 626.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(             Reference Range  <pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Negative ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Positive results will be reported as JC virus DNA detected.</pre>  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Order Form:  A-1a Miscellaneous Request or Epic Req  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  <pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Maintain sterility. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              JC virus \(JCV\), a member of the genus Polyomavirus, is a small ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              nonenveloped DNA-containing virus. Primary infection occurs in early ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              childhood, with a prevalence of >80%.\(1\) The virus is latent but can be ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              reactivated in immunosuppressed patients, especiallythose with AIDS. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              JCV is recognized as the etiologic agent of progressive multifocal ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              leukoencephalopathy \(PML\), a fatal demyelinating disease of the central ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              nervous system.\(2-4\) Histologic examination of brain biopsy tissue may ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              reveal characteristic pathologic changes localized mainly in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              oligodendrocytes and astrocytes. Detection of JCV DNA by PCR \(target ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              gene, large T antigen\) in the cerebrospinal fluid specimens of patients ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              with suspected PML infection has replaced the need for biopsy tissue ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              for laboratory diagnosis.\(5\) This molecular amplification technology ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              provides a faster, easier, and more sensitive test for diagnosing of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              JCV infection compared with brain biopsy pathology. Importantly, the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              PCR test is specific with no cross-reaction with BK virus \(BKV\), a ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              closely related polyomavirus. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              A negative result does not rule out the possibility of JCV infection. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              This test is not to be used as a diagnostic tool for Creutzfeldt-Jakob ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              disease \(CJD\).</pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Methodology  <pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Real-Time Polymerase Chain Reaction \(PCR\)/DNA Probe ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Hybridization ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Viral nucleic acid is extracted from the specimen using the MagNA Pure ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              automated instrument \(Roche Applied Science\). Primers are directed to ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              the large T antigen gene, which is a conserved sequence specific for ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              JCV. This assay detects only JCV; it does not detect BK Virus or SV 40 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 251.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(other polyomaviruses\). The LightCycler instrument \(Roche Applied ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Science\) amplifies and monitors the development of target nucleic acid ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 232.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              sequences after the annealing step during PCR cycling. This automated ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 222.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              PCR system can rapidly detect amplicon development through stringent ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 213.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              air-controlled temperature cycling in capillary cuvettes. The detection ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 203.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              of amplified products is based on the fluorescence resonance energy ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 194.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              transfer \(FRET\) principle. For FRET product detection, a hybridization ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 184.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              probe with a donor fluorophore, fluorescein, on the 3'-end is excited ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 174.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              by an external light source and emits light that is absorbed by a ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 165.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              second hybridization probe with an acceptor fluorophore, LC-Red 640, at ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 155.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              the 5'-end. The acceptor fluorophore then emits a light of a different ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 146.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              wavelength that can be measured with a signal that is proportional to ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 136.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              the amount of specific PCR product.</pre>  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 126.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(               Analytic Time  5 days upon receipt at reference laboratory  ) Tj
/F21 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 37 Tm
(434) Tj
