(                     Minimum  3 mL lavender top tube \(EDTA\), green top tube \(Heparin\), or special ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 635.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              trace metals tube or ONE lavender top \(EDTA\) microtube for pediatric ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 626.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              patients.  It is recommended that patients at high risk for having ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              elevated lead concentrations have a venous \(as opposed to capillary\) ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              sample drawn to facilitate confirmatory testing if blood lead ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              concentration exceeds 15 &#956;g/dL.  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
