1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              LpX<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Undetectable  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Order Form:  A-1a Miscellaneous Request or Epic Req  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  <u>Useful For</u>:<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Evaluation of increased risk for cardiovascular disease and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              events:<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              -Most appropriately measured in individuals at intermediate risk for ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              cardiovascular disease according to the individuals' Framingham risk ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              score<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              -Patients with early atherosclerosis or strong family history of early ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              atherosclerosis without explanation by traditional risk factors should ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              also be considered for testing<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <u>Cautions</u>:<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Lp\(a\) cholesterol values should not be confused with Lp\(a\) mass values, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              although they are highly correlated. Lp\(a\) cholesterol values will be ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              approximately 10X lower than Lp\(a\) mass values, but the difference ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              between the measures is not uniform. Lp\(a\) mass values are considered ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              elevated when >30 mg/dL. Lp\(a\) cholesterol is increased if > or =3 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              mg/dL.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <u>Clinical Information</u>:<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Lipoprotein \(a\) \(Lp[a]\) is a highly heterogeneous molecule, consisting ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              of a low-density lipoprotein \(LDL\) with a highly glycosylated ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              apolipoprotein\(a\) \(apo[a]\) covalently linked to the apolipoprotein B ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              moiety of LDL via a single disulfate bond. Lp\(a\) has been associated ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              with atherogenesis and promotion of thrombosis. Increased levels of Lp ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(a\) have been estimated to confer a 1.5 to 3.0-fold increased risk for ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              coronary artery disease \(CAD\) in many but not all studies. Apo\(a\) has ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              approximately 80% structural homology with plasminogen, but does not ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              contain the active site for fibrin cleavage. One proposed mechanism for ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Lp\(a\)'s atherogenicity is competition for binding sites with ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              plasminogen during fibrin clot formation and the resulting inhibition ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              of fibrinolysis. Recently a high correlation was demonstrated between  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 251.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Lp ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(a\) and oxidized LDL, suggesting that the atherogenicity of Lp\(a\) ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 232.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              lipoprotein may be mediated in part by associated proinflammatory ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 222.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              oxidized phospholipids.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 213.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 203.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Lack of standardization of assays and apo\(a\) heterogeneity may ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 194.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              partially account for these discrepancies. The heterogeneity of Lp\(a\) ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 184.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              arises mainly from the variable number of kringle repeats in the apo\(a\) ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 174.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              portion of the molecule. Kringles are specific structural domains ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 165.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              containing 3 intra-strand disulfide bonds that are highly homologous to ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 155.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              similar repeats found in plasminogen.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 146.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 136.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              In the clinical laboratory, immunologic methods are generally used to ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 126.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              quantify Lp\(a\) protein mass. Reagents for Lp\(a\) mass measurement are ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 117.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              available from multiple manufacturers and although standardization ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 107.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              efforts are underway, currently available methods are not standardized. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 98.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Difficulties in standardizing Lp\(a\) mass measurement arise from the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 88.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              variability in signals produced by different reagents due to the size ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 78.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              polymorphisms of apo\(a\). For this reason, some elevations of Lp\(a\) mass ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 69.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              are associated with low levels of Lp\(a\) cholesterol. Lp\(a\) ) Tj
/F21 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 37 Tm
(Updated:Mon Aug 26 14:13:27 2013) Tj
