1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              supportive of Lyme disease.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              A positive result indicates that the Western blot evaluation for ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <em>Borrelia burgdorferi</em> antibody is consistent with the presence ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              of antibody produced by patients in response to infection by ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <em>Borrelia burgdorferi</em> and suggests the presence of Lyme ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              disease. Although the test has been shown to have a high degree of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              reliability for diagnostic purposes, laboratory data should always be ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              correlated with clinical findings.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Current CDC recommendations for the serological diagnosis of Lyme ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              disease are to screen with a polyvalent ELISA test and confirm ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              equivocals and positives with Western blot. Both IgM and IgG Western ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 251.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              blots should be performed on specimens obtained less than four weeks ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              after appearance of erythema migrans or disease symptoms. Only IgG ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 232.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Western blot is to be performed on specimens greater than four weeks ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 222.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              after disease onset. IgM Western blot in the chronic stage is not ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 213.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              recommended and does not aid in the diagnosis of neuroborreliosis or ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 203.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              chronic Lyme disease. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 184.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
