(                 Order Form:  A-1a Miscellaneous Request or Epic Req  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  This panel is appropriate for Lyme disease testing greater than ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              four weeks from erythema migrans or onset of disease symptoms.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              If ELISA result is 1.00 LIV, then IgG Western blot will be added. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Additional charges apply.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              A negative result indicates that the Western blot evaluation for ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <em>Borrelia burgdorferi</em> antibody demonstrates no antibodies ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              unique to <em>Borrelia burgdorferi</em>, and therefore is not ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              supportive of Lyme disease.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              A positive result indicates that the Western blot evaluation for ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <em>Borrelia burgdorferi</em> antibody is consistent with the presence ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              of antibody produced by patients in response to infection by ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <em>Borrelia burgdorferi</em> and suggests the presence of Lyme ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              disease. Although the test has been shown to have a high degree of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              reliability for diagnostic purposes, laboratory data should always be ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              correlated with clinical findings.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Current CDC recommendations for the serological diagnosis of Lyme ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              disease are to screen with a polyvalent EIA test and confirm equivocal ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 251.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              and positive with Western blot. Both IgM and IgG Western blots should ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              be performed on specimens obtained less than four weeks after ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 232.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              appearance of erythema migrans. Only IgG Western blot is to be ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 222.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              performed on specimens greater than four weeks after disease onset. IgM ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 213.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Western blot in the chronic stage is not recommended and does not aid ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 203.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              in the diagnosis of neuroborreliosis or chronic Lyme disease. Please ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 194.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              submit requests for appropriate Western blot testing within 10 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 184.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              days. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 165.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Methodology  Semi-Quantitative Enzyme-Linked Immunosorbent Assay/Qualitative Western ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 155.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
