1 0 0 1 102.0 515.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              with polyethylene glycol \(PEG\).  A decrease of greater than 50% when ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 506.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              precipitated with polyethylene glycol indicates the possible presence ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 496.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
