(                              If screening for Neuroblastoma, the following tests are suggested: ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              CAT24 \(Catecholamines, Fractionated; Dopamine is included\), HVA24 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 251.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(Homovanillic Acid\), VMA24 \(Vanillylmandelic Acid\). ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 232.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Secreting neuroendocrine tumors typically are associated with ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 222.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              metanephrine or normetanephrine concentrations several times higher ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 213.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              than the upper reference intervals. Other reasons for elevated ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 203.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              concentrations include intense physical activity, life-threatening ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 194.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              illness, and drug interferences. Essential hypertension is often ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 184.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              associated with slight elevations \(metanephrine less than 3500 nmol/day ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 174.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              and normetanephrine less than 4900 nmol/day\). Other reasons for slight ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 165.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              and moderate elevations include emotional and physical stress and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 155.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
