1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              10mm<sup>2</sup> in surface area on the block.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Must also submit a healthy tissue specimen or peripheral blood from the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              same subject for comparison of microsatellite markers.  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(         Rejection Criteria:  Specimens fixed in B5 fixative or that have been decalcified will not ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              be accepted.  Tumor specimens containing less than 50% tumor cells or ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              are less than 10mm<sup>2</sup> in area may be unacceptable.  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(             Reference Range  Microsatellite Stable  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
