1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  Tumor tissue and normal tissue should be obtained as part of the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              surgical procedure for testing.  The tissue should be formalin-fixed, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              paraffin embedded and reviewed by a surgical pathologist prior to MSI ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 251.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              testing.  A block containing normal tissue \(non-tumor\) should be ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              submitted for testing in addition to a block containing at least 50% ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 232.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              tumor.  Acceptable tissue for the non-tumor block is tissue with a high ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 222.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              nuclear content, preferably benign lymph node tissue if available. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 213.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Blood submitted in EDTA or sodium citrate is acceptable for the normal ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 203.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              block if tissue is not available. An H&E stained glass slide from both ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 194.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              blocks should also be submitted. ) Tj
