(                              "MSH-6, Immunostain" - 88342/\(if appropriate\)<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 712.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              "PMS-2, Immunostain" - 88342/\(if appropriate\)  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 702.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(           Collection Medium  Miscellaneous container; contact laboratory  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 693.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(             Reference Range  An interpretive report will be provided.  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 683.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Order Form:  A-1a Miscellaneous Request or Epic Req  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 674.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  Mismatch repair protein immunohistochemistry is useful to screen for ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 664.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Lynch syndrome and to determine the functional status of the DNA ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 654.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              mismatch repair apparatus.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 645.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 635.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              A normal result argues against the presence of Lynch syndrome and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 626.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              indicates with a high degree of specificity that the tumor has ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              proficient mismatch repair function.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Microsatellite instability testing is complementary and may be used to ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              confirm a normal result.  Depending on the pattern of staining with an ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              abnormal result, additional testing and/or genetic counseling may be ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              indicated.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Test results should be interpreted in the context of clinical findings, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              family history, and other laboratory data. Errors may occur in our ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
