(                              antigens from the four Neisseria meningitidis serogroups included in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 184.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              the licensed meningococcal vaccine. The meningococcal vaccine response ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 174.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              is best evaluated by testing pre-vaccination and post-vaccination ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 165.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              samples in parallel. A two-fold or greater increase for at least two ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 155.6 Tm
