1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  <pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Contact Commercial Mailouts at 356-8593 to obtain collection tubes for ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              this testing.  No other specimen collection container is acceptable by ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              the reference laboratory. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Patients should be fasting for 10-12 hours prior to specimen ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              collection.  Antacid medications or medications that affect intestinal ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              motility should be discontinued, if possible, for at least 48 hours ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              prior to collection. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Neurokinin A is a ten amino acid putative transmitter synthesized in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              the neurons it is present in.  Neurokinin A is a member of the family ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              called Tachykinins which also include Neurokinin B, Substance P, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Physalaemin, and Eledoisin.   Neurokinin A shares 6 of 10 peptide ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              homologies with Neurokinin B even though they are produced by different ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              genes.   Neurokinin A is also very similar in structure to Substance P ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              and produces some of the same biological actions as Substance P. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Neurokinin A is a potent bronchoconstrictor.  In the gut, Neurokinin A ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              is produced by the intrinsic enteric nervous system.</pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Methodology  Direct Radioimmunoassay  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(               Analytic Time  2 weeks upon receipt at reference laboratory  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(            Testing Schedule  Varies  ) Tj
/F21 10 Tf
