1 0 0 1 102.0 654.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                     Minimum  Preferred Minimum:  3.0 mL from a random urine collection<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 645.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Abslute Minimum:  1.0 mL from a random urine collection  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 635.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(             Reference Range  An interpretive report will be provided.  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 626.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Order Form:  A-1a Miscellaneous Request or Epic Req  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  Oligosaccharides \(carbohydrate compounds\) are routinely excreted in the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              urine. There is an increased accumulation of oligosaccharides in the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              urine of individuals with the any of the mucolipidoses and certain ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              glycoprotein storage disorders. Glycoprotein storage disorders are ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              caused by deficiencies of enzymes required for the degradation of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              oligosaccharide chains \(see table below\).<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Oligosaccharidoses clinically resemble mucopolysaccharidoses and may ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              present on a spectrum from almost normal to any of the following ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              clinical symptoms: coarse facial features, bone and joint dysplasia, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              hepatosplenomegaly, and mental regression. Not all oligosaccharidoses ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              have detectable oligosaccharides, depending on the amount excreted in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              the urine. Patients with alpha-mannosidosis, alpha-fucosidosis, and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              aspartylglucosaminuria may have very subtle excretions. Patients with ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              beta-mannosidosis, mucolipidosis II, and mucolipidosis III, generally ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              do not have detectable oligosaccharides in urine. Urinary ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              oligosaccharides may also be detected in Pompe disease \(a glycogen ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              storage disease\), Gaucher disease \(a lysosomal storage disease\), and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Sandhoff disease \(a sphingolipidosis\). Clinical correlation is strongly ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              recommended.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <u>Disorder</u>                           <u>Defective enzyme</u> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Alpha-mannosidosis                 Alpha-mannosidase ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Beta-mannosidosis                  Beta-mannosidase ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Alpha-fucosidosis                  Alpha-fucosidase ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Sialidosis                         Alpha-neuraminidase ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Galactosialidosis                  Beta-galactosidase and neuraminidase ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Aspartylglucosaminuria             Aspartylglycosaminidase ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Schindler disease                  Alpha-N-acetylgalactosaminidase ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Mucolipidosis II \(I-cell disease\)  N-acetylglycosmaine-1- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                                                   phosphotransferase ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Mucolipidosis III                  N-acetylglycosmaine-1- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                                \(pseudo-Hurler polydystrophy\)      phosphotransferase</pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <strong><u>Cautions</u>:</strong>  The test can give false-negative ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              results, especially in older patients with mild clinical presentations. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Patients with sialidosis or mucolipidosis II or III are not reliably ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 251.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              detected.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 232.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              In infants, many oligosaccharide bands are often detected and the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 222.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              clinical significance of the results may be uncertain. Retesting ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 213.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              between the ages of 6 months to 1 year is recommended.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 203.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 194.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Enzyme analysis is required to confirm suspected diagnosis.</pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 174.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Methodology  Thin Layer Chromatography \(TLC\)  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 165.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(               Analytic Time  2 working days upon receipt at reference laboratory  ) Tj
/F21 10 Tf
