(                              CMV testing is determined by protocol.  Two version exist: ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 218.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              1\) Screen with no reflex. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 206.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              2\) Screen with reflex to IgG and IgM. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 182.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              If you require Antibody to Trypanosoma cruzi \(Anti-T.cruzi\) testing ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 170.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(TCRUZIMN\) this must be ordered on the requisition along with the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 158.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              ORGTMN. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 134.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              If you require West Nile Virus nucleic acid testing \(WNVNAT\) this must ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 122.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              be ordered on the requisition along with the ORGTMN. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 98.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              These tests may be ordered only if the patient is part of the donor ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 86.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              network, sperm, egg or embryo donor, autologous blood donor or stem ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 74.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              cell donor. ) Tj
