1 0 0 1 102.0 381.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              determination by gas chromatography-mass spectrometry stable isotope ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 371.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              dilution analysis can effectively overcome the limitations of standard ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 362.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              organic acid analysis for the investigation of non-acutely ill  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 352.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              patients. ) Tj
