(Paroxysmal Nocturnal Hemoglobinuria \(PNH\) Screen) Tj
/F00 8 Tf
0.0000 Tw
( ) Tj
/F10 8 Tf
1 0 0 1 102.0 760.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                  Laboratory  Flow Cytometry Service  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 750.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    CPT Code  <pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 741.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
