(                    Comments  <pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              This assay will allow measurement of free insulin by removal of anti- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              insulin antibodies with PEG \(polyethylene glycol\). This assay is ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              intended for patients where it is suspected that the insulin assay is ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              interfered with by auto-antibodies to insulin.  This most commonly ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              occurs with patients treated with non-human insulins \(e.g., cow or pig\) ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              and is very rare for patients treated with the modern recombinant human ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              insulins.  An analysis of data in the Chemistry laboratory from 2006- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              2009 indicated that the rate of antibody interference with the insulin ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              assay is less than 1 in 3,000 patients. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              The laboratory will report results both with PEG precipitation \(free ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              insulin\) and without PEG precipitation \(total insulin\). A glucose will ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              be automatically done on each specimen at no additional charge. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              This insulin assay does NOT measure the insulin analogs lispro ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(Humalog\), aspart \(NovoLog\), and glargine \(Lantus\). Please contact the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              laboratory if an assay with cross-reactivity to these insulin analogs ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              is required. </pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
