0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  For patients who repeatedly have platelet clumps which preclude ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 194.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              determination of an accurate platelet count, it is now possible to ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 184.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              order a platelet count from a citrate tube. In many cases the EDTA in a ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 174.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              lavender top tube causes the platelet clumping which does not occur in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 165.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              a blue top \(citrate tube\).  Use order code PLTB to order the Platelet ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 155.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Count, Blue Top \(Citrate\) Tube.  The Epic order code is LAB7882. This ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 146.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              test is available 24 hours a day, 7 days a week. This test cannot be ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 136.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              done on a citrate tube drawn for coagulation testing. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 117.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
