1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  This mailout test requires pathologist approval for orders during ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              inpatient encounters.  Mailouts staff will not process order without ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              approval.  The pathologist covering mailouts approval can be reached at ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              pager #5379.  If approval is given, the name of the pathologist can be ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              selected in the drop-down menu to the right of the approval warning in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Epic when ordering the test.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
