0.0000 Tw
(                              Please print, complete and submit the <a ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              href=  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              "http://www.healthcare.uiowa.edu/labs/morl/HearingLossRequisition. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              pdf">Hearing Loss Testing Requisition</a> from the Molecular ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Otolaryngology & Renal Research Laboratory, to Specimen ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Control/Mailouts with the specimen and the Epic Requisition. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 251.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Methodology  Screening for POU3F4 is performed by sequencing and STRP analysis. The ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              initial screening test uses oligonucleotide primers that amplify the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 232.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              exon of POU3F4 followed by direct sequencing to determine whether ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 222.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              mutations lie within the POU3F4 gene. In the absence of a POU3F4 coding ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 213.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              mutation, the upstream region of POU3F4 is screened for a possible ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 203.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              deletion by running 8 STSs that cover approximately 1200 kB of genomic ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 194.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              DNA at regularly spaced intervals. These markers are PCR amplified, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 184.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              resolved by gel electrophoresis and scored as present or absent.  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 174.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
