(                    Comments  The PBC Antibody Screen is an enzyme-linked immunosorbent assay \(ELISA\) ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              for the semi-quantitative detection of mitochondrial antibodies, gp210 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
