1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              serum.  The presence of mitochondrial, gp210 and sp100 antibodies can ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              be used in conjunction with clinical findings and other laboratory ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              tests to aid in the diagnosis of primary biliary cirrhosis.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
