1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Assay values obtained with different manufacturers' methods may not be ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 232.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              used interchangeably. The magnitude of the reported antibody levels can ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 222.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              not be correlated to an endpoint titer. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 203.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
