1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              See:  "PSA, Total" to order monitoring PSA test. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              PSA measurement used in conjunction with DRE \(digital rectal exam\) is ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              indicated as an aid for the detection of prostate cancer in men aged 50 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              years or older, must be identified as PSA for screening.  It is also ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              useful in monitoring patients with known prostate cancer. PSA is ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              specific to the prostate gland and is present in normal, hyperplastic ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              and neoplastic prostatic epithelium.  Plasma elevations are detected in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              not only prostate carcinoma, but also in benign prostatic hypertrophy ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              and inflammatory conditions of the prostate and adjacent genitourinary ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              tissues.  Diagnosis of prostate cancer requires biopsy and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              histopathologic examination. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Effective 12-31-99, changed Total PSA method.  New immunoassay is ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              equimolar and gives results slightly lower than Hybritech ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              immunoassay.</pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                        See:  <br />Prostate-Specific Antigen \(PSA\), Total, Plasma  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
