0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  <u>Useful For</u>:<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Confirming the diagnosis of hereditary pancreatitis \(HP\) in patients ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              with chronic pancreatitis<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Ruling out HP in patients with chronic pancreatitis<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <u>Cautions:</u><br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              A small percentage of individuals who are carriers or have a diagnosis ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              of hereditary pancreatitis \(HP\) may have a mutation that is not ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              identified by this method \(eg, mutations in other exons, promoter ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              mutations\). The absence of a mutation\(s\), therefore, does not eliminate ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              the possibility of positive carrier status or the diagnosis of HP. For ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              carrier testing, it is important to first document the presence of a ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <em>PRSS1</em> gene mutation in an affected family member.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              In some cases, DNA alterations of undetermined significance may be ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              identified.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Rare polymorphisms exist that could lead to false-negative or false- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              positive results. If results obtained do not match the clinical ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              findings, additional testing should be considered.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              A previous bone marrow transplant from an allogenic donor will ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              interfere with testing.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Test results should be interpreted in the context of clinical findings, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              family history, and other laboratory data. Errors in our interpretation ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              of results may occur if information given is inaccurate or ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              incomplete.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Please print, complete, and submit the following with the appropriate ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              signatures and the correct sample type:<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <a href="http://www.mayoreferenceservices.org/it-mmfiles/MolGenCongenitalInheritedInfoSheet.pdf">Molecular Genetics - ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Congenital Inherited Diseases Patient Information Sheet</a> and the <a ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              href="http://www.mayomedicallaboratories.com/it- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              mmfiles/InformedConsent.pdf">Informed Consent for DNA Testing</a> from ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
