0.0000 Tw
(                  Laboratory  Commercial Mail-out Laboratory  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 750.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                  Order Code  QTB  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 741.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    CPT Code  86480  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 731.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(           Collection Medium  Miscellaneous container; contact laboratory  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 722.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                     Minimum  1 mL per tube \(THREE tubes required\): NIL, Antigen, Mitogen  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 712.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(         Rejection Criteria:  Specimens other than plasma in QTB collection vials.  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 702.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(             Reference Range  Negative  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 693.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Order Form:  A-1a Miscellaneous Request or Epic Req  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 683.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  <u>Collection kit containing 3 tubes \(NIL, Antigen, Mitogen\) are the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 674.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              ONLY tube types validated</u>.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 664.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 654.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <strong class="style_red">Contact Core Laboratory at \(356-3527\) or ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 645.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Mailouts at \(356-8593\) for the THREE tubes \(NIL, Antigen, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 635.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Mitogen\).</strong><br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 626.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <strong><u>Cautions</u>:</strong><br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              A positive QuantiFERON-TB Gold result may not indicate infection with ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <em>Mycobacterium tuberculosis</em>; false positives do occur.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              A negative QuantiFERON-TB Gold result does not preclude the possibility ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              of <em>Mycobacterium tuberculosis</em> infection or tuberculosis ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              disease. Falsely-negative results can be due to the stage of infection ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(eg, specimen drawn prior to the development of cellular immune ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              response\), comorbid conditions that affect immune functions, or other ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              individual immunological factors.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              A false-negative QuantiFERON-TB Gold result can be caused by incorrect ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              blood specimen drawn or improper handling of the specimen affecting ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              lymphocyte function. Blood must be incubated with stimulation antigens ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              within 16 hours of draw. Delay in incubation may cause false-negative ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              or indeterminate results.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              The effect of lymphocyte count on reliability is unknown. Lymphocyte ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              counts may vary from person to person. The minimum number required for ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              a reliable result has not been established.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
