(         Rejection Criteria:  Specimens other than Whole blood<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Anticoagulants other than  ACD    ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(             Reference Range  Definitive results and an interpretive report will be provided.  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Order Form:  A-1a Miscellaneous Request or Epic Req  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  All enzyme defects, including erythrocyte enzyme errors, are inherited; ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              some are sex-linked and located on the X chromosome.  Some family ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              members have no hematologic abnormalities, while others have a ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              hemolytic anemia. For a number of red blood cell enzyme defects \(e.g., ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              deficiencies of hexokinase, glucose phosphate isomerase, pyruvate ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              kinase\), the sole clinical manifestation is hemolytic anemia.  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Glucose-6- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              phosphate dehydrogenase deficiency is the most common metabolic error ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              of the red cell and presents with acute hemolytic anemia in response to ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              oxidant stress \(e.g., drugs, acute infections, fava bean ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              ingestion\).<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              This is a consultative evaluation looking at red cell enzyme defects as ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              the cause for early red cell destruction.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Useful for:  Identifying defects of red cell enzyme metabolism and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              evaluating patients with hemolytic anemia.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Glutathione is reflexed \(added by reference laboratory\) if original ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              enzyme information is normal.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <strong>Testing Algorithm</strong><br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              This is a consultative evaluation in which the case will be evaluated ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              at the reference laboratory, the appropriate tests performed at an ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 251.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              additional charge, and the results interpreted.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 232.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Reflexed RBC Enzymes includes: adenosine deaminase, adenylate kinase, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 222.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              phosphofructokinase, phosphoglycerate kinase, triosephosphate ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 213.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              isomerase, and pyrimidine 5'nucleotidase ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 194.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Methodology  Kinetic Spectrophotometry \(KS\)  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 184.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(               Analytic Time  2-10 days upon receipt at reference laboratory  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 174.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(            Testing Schedule  Monday through Friday; Varies  ) Tj
/F21 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 37 Tm
(Updated:Mon Aug 26 14:13:27 2013) Tj
