(                     Minimum  <pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 645.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Preferred minimum: 2.0 mL lavender top tube \(EDTA\) ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 635.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Absolute minimum: 0.5 mL whole blood ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Contact Clinical Pathology/Core Laboratory for other specimen options ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(356-3527\):  Amniotic Fluid or Chorionic Villus</pre>  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(             Reference Range  An interpretive report will be provided.  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Order Form:  A-1a Miscellaneous Request or Epic Req  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  <u>Useful For</u>:<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Confirmation of diagnosis of multiple endocrine neoplasia type 2 \(MEN ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              2\), MEN 2B, and familial medullary thyroid carcinoma \(FMTC\)<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Documentation of germline mutation to distinguish FMTC from sporadic ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              multifocal medullary thyroid carcinoma<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <u>Cautions</u>:<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              A small percentage of individuals who are carriers or have a diagnosis ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              of multiple endocrine neoplasia type 2 \(MEN2\) may have a mutation that ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              is not identified by this method \(eg, mutations in other exons, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              promoter mutations\). The absence of a mutation\(s\), therefore, does not ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              eliminate the possibility of positive carrier status or the diagnosis ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              of MEN2. For carrier testing, it is important to first document the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              presence of a <em>RET</em> proto-oncogene mutation in an affected ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              family member.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              In some cases, DNA alterations of undetermined significance may be ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              identified.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Rare polymorphisms exist that could lead to false-negative or false- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              positive results. If results obtained do not match the clinical ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              findings, additional testing should be considered.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              A previous bone marrow transplant from an allogenic donor will ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              interfere with testing. <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Test results should be interpreted in the context of clinical findings, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              family history, and other laboratory data. Errors in our interpretation ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              of results may occur if information given is inaccurate or incomplete. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Please print, complete and submit the following forms to the lab, with ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              the specimen and the A-1a Miscellaneous Request:  <a ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              href= "http://www.mayomedicallaboratories.com/it- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 251.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              mmfiles/MolGenInheritedCancer.pdf">Molecular Genetics- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Inherited Cancer Syndromes Patient Information Sheet</a> and the <a ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 232.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              href= "http://www.mayomedicallaboratories.com/it- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 222.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              mmfiles/Informed_Consent_for_Genetic_Testing_mc1235-117.pdf">Informed ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 213.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Consent Form for DNA Testing</a> from the Mayo Medical ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 203.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Laboratories.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 194.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 184.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              This mailout test requires pathologist approval for orders during ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 174.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              inpatient encounters.  Mailouts staff will not process order without ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 165.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              approval.  The pathologist covering mailouts approval can be reached at ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 155.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              pager #5379.  If approval is given, the name of the pathologist can be ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 146.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              selected in the drop-down menu to the right of the approval warning in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 136.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Epic when ordering the test. ) Tj
