0.0000 Tw
(                              1.1 AI or greater: Positive - IgM antibody to rubella detected, which ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              may indicate a current or past rubella infection .  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Order Form:  A-1a General Lab or Epic Req  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  For workup related to possible rubella infection, acute and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              convalescent specimens must be labeled as such; parallel testing is ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              preferred and convalescent specimens must be received within 30 days ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              from receipt of the acute specimens. Please mark specimen plainly ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              as "ACUTE" or "CONVALESCENT."<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              In children and adults, rubella infection usually results in a mild ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              exanthematous disease. However, infection during pregnancy, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              particularly in the first trimester, can result in fetal death or ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              the "rubella syndrome," a spectrum of congenital defects that includes ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              cataracts, deafness, glaucoma, congenital heart disease, and mental ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              retardation. About ten to 20 percent of newborns infected in utero fail ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              to survive past the first year of life. Since complications of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              congenital rubella infection are so severe, diagnosis of infection ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              during the first trimester of pregnancy may influence the decision to ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              terminate or continue the pregnancy. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Methodology  Multiplex Flow Immunoassay  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(               Analytic Time  3 hours \(upon receipt in laboratory\)  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
