0.0000 Tw
(                              the transferrin receptor \(TfR\).  If the intracellular iron stores are ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              exhausted - corresponding to a ferritin concentration of less than 12 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              g/L - then more TfR is expressed.  The affinity of the transferrin ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              receptor to transferrin depends on the latter's loading state.  As 80- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              95% of the transferrin receptor molecules are localized on ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              erythropoietic cells, the TfR concentration \(and hence also the sTfR ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              concentration\) reflects the iron requirement of these cells.  When iron ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              deficiency exits, the sTfR concentration in serum rises even before the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              hemoglobin concentration is significantly depressed.  The sTfR ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              concentration status can be obtained by determining the sTfR index ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(=sTfR concentration/log ferritin concentration\). ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Methodology  Immunoturbidimetric Assay  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
