1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              The primers and probes in the Xpert SA Nasal Complete assay detects a ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              proprietary sequence for the staphylococcal protein A \(<em>spa</em>\) ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              gene, the gene for methicillin resistance \(<em>mec</em>A\), and the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              staphylococcal cassette chromosome mec \(SCC<em>mec</em>\) inserted into ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              the SA chromosomal <em>attB</em> site.  Inhibition of the SA Nasal ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Complete assay resulting in Invalid or false Negative test results has ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              been observed in the presence of inhaled nasal steroids Flonase and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Nasonex.  Reliable results are dependent on proper specimen collection, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              handling, and storage. ) Tj
