1 0 0 1 102.0 626.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              required.</strong>  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(         Rejection Criteria:  Specimens other than plasma.  ) Tj
