1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              30 - 59 mmol/L = intermediate ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Greater than or equal to 60 mmol/L = indicative of cystic fibrosis ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              For individuals older than 6 months of age: ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Less than or equal to 39 mmol/L = cystic fibrosis is unlikely ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              40 - 59 mmol/L = intermediate ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Greater than or equal to 60 mmol/L = indicative of cystic fibrosis ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              NOTE:  Sweat chloride values less than 30 mmol/L have been documented ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              in genetically proven CF patients.  Clinical correlation is ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 251.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              necessary.</pre>  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
