1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Values for normal patients not taking these synthetic glucocorticoids ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              should be less than the cutoff concentration \(detection limit\).  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Order Form:  A-1a Miscellaneous Request or Epic Req  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  <u>Clinical Information</u>:<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Synthetic glucocorticoids are widely used and have important clinical ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              utility both as anti-inflammatory and immunosuppressive agents. The ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              medical use of these agents, as well as their surreptitious use, can ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              sometimes lead to a confusing clinical presentation. Patients exposed ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              to these steroids may present with clinical features of Cushing ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              syndrome, but with suppressed cortisol levels and evidence of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              hypothalamus-pituitary-adrenal axis suppression.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <u>Useful For</u>:<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Confirming the presence of the listed synthetic glucocorticoids \(see ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Interpretive Data\)<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Confirming the cause of secondary adrenal insufficiency.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              This assay does not detect fluticasone propionate.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <u>Cautions</u>:<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              This method cannot detect all of the available synthetic steroids ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              either available as pharmaceutical compounds or chemicals present in ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              food. The assay confirms only the listed synthetic glucocorticoids \(see ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Interpretive Data\).<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 251.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Lack of detection does not preclude use of synthetic glucocorticoid ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 232.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              because adrenal suppression may persist for some time after the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 222.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              exogenous steroid is discontinued. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 203.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                See Appendix  See Additional Information: <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 194.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Urine Tests Requiring no Preservatives  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 184.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Methodology  Liquid Chromatography-Tandem Mass Spectrometry \(LC-MS/MS\) Stable ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 174.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Isotope Dilution Analysis  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 165.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(               Analytic Time  4 days upon receipt at reference laboratory  ) Tj
