1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Cross Reacting Drugs  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Methodology  Assay is based on the kinetic interaction of microparticles in a ) Tj
