1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Screen includes THC with a cutoff of 50 ng/mL for the main metabolite ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              of THC \(9-carboxy-THC\).  Effective April 12, 2010, THC was no longer ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              included on the routine drugs of abuse-urine panel "Drugs of Abuse ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Screen". ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              If confirmation is needed for THC, call the Laboratory at 356-3527. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Allow up to seven days for confirmatory results.  Confirmation is at an ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              additional charge. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              It is highly unlikely that passive \(second-hand\) inhalation of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              marijuana smoke will result in a positive screening test.  Research ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              studies have shown that maximum urinary concentrations of 9-carboxy-THC ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              levels only reach 15-20 ng/mL following passive inhalation of heavy ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              marijuana smoke. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              References: ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Cone EJ, Johnson RE, Darwin WD, Yousefnejad D, Mell LD, Paul BD, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Mitchell J.  Passive inhalation of marijuana smoke: urinarlysis and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              room air levels of delta-9-tetrahydrocannabinol.  J Anal Toxicol ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              1987;11:89-96. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Hammett-Stabler CA, Pesce AJ, Cannon DJ.  Urine Drug Screening in the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
