1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  Useful for an adjunct to anti-thyroid peroxidase \(anti-TPO\) ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              autoantibody, antithyrotropin-receptor autoantibody, and thyroid- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              stimulating immunoglobulin measurements in the diagnosis of autoimmune ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              thyroid diseases: Hashimoto disease, postpartum thyroiditis, neonatal ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              hypothyroidism, and Graves disease.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <strong><u>Cautions</u>:</strong><br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Low titers of thyroid autoantibodies may be observed in the absence of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              autoimmune or other thyroid diseases and are considered a nonspecific ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              finding. The population prevalence of such nonspecific low-level anti- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              thyroglobulin \(anti-Tg\) positivity is higher in females than in males ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              and increases with age in both genders. <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Anti-Tg values determined by different methodologies might vary ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              significantly and cannot be directly compared with one another. Some ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              patients might show to be antibody-positive by some methods and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              antibody-negative by others. Comparing anti-Tg antibodies values from ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              different methods might lead to erroneous clinical interpretation.<br  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              In patients receiving therapy with high biotin doses \(ie, >5 mg/day\), ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              no specimen should be drawn until at least 8 hours after the last ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              biotin administration. <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Tg concentrations >2,000 ng/mL may lead to falsely elevated anti-Tg ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              concentrations. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                        See:  <br />Thyroglobulin, Tumor Marker \(Includes Anti-TG\), Serum  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
