1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Reference values apply to all ages.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              THYROGLOBULIN, TUMOR MARKER<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              > or =16 years: < or =33 ng/mL<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Athyrotic individuals normally have human thyroglobulin values < or =2 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              ng/mL.  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Order Form:  A-1a Miscellaneous Request or Epic Req  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  Useful for follow-up of patients with differentiated thyroid cancers ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              after thyroidectomy and ablation.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              An aid in determining the presence of thyroid metastasis to lymph ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              nodes.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <strong><u>Cautions</u>:</strong>The test is most sensitive for ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              detection of thyroid cancer recurrence when patients are off thyroid ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              replacement long enough to have an elevated thyroid-stimulating hormone ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(TSH\) prior to drawing the specimen. This test also can be used to ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              follow patients with normal TSH; however, thyroglobulin \(Tg\) values ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              from specimens with high TSH should not be compared with values with ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              normal TSH, because TSH stimulation changes the baseline ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              determinations.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 414.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Thyroid autoantibodies may interfere with the measurement of Tg. All ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              specimens are prescreened for antibodies and a comment appended to the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 386.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              report if they are present. Undetectable levels of Tg should be ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              interpreted with caution if anti-Tg is present. A Tg antibody result of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <22 IU/mL is unlikely to cause clinically significant Tg assay ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              interference. It is recommended that the Tg result be reviewed for ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              concordance with clinical presentation. <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 338.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 328.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Specimens with Tg concentrations >250,000 ng/mL may "hook" and appear ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              to have markedly lower levels. <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Anti-Tg values determined by different methodologies might vary ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              significantly and cannot be directly compared with one another. Some ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              patients might show to be antibody-positive by some methods and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              antibody-negative by others. Comparing anti-Tg antibodies values from ) Tj
