1 0 0 1 102.0 760.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                  Laboratory  Immunopathology  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 750.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                  Order Code  UCANCAS  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 741.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    CPT Code  <pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 731.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              86255 UC-ANCA Screen \(Technical\) ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 722.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              86255-26 UC-ANCA Screen \(Professional Interpretation\)</pre>  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 712.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(           Collection Medium  <table> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 702.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <tr> ) Tj
