0.0000 Tw
(                              <td align=center></td></tr> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 683.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <tr> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 674.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <td width="110" valign="top" align="center">Red top tube</td> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 664.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              </tr> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 654.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              </table> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 635.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                     Minimum  <pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 626.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Adult - 5 mL red top tube ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Pediatric - 2 mL red top tube</pre>  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(             Reference Range  <1:40 titer, includes interpretative report.  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Order Form:  A-1a Immunopathology or Epic Req  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  <pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              "UC-ANCA" \(also called "atypical P-ANCA" or "X-ANCA"\) is the type of ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              ANCA most commonly found in some patients with certain inflammatory ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              bowel and liver disease, namely, ulcerative colitis \(72-80%\), primary ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              sclerosing cholangitis \(72-80%\), and autoimmune hepatitis type 1 ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(50-80%\). A subset of patients with Crohn's Disease limited to the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              colon, may also be positive. Some patients with autoimmune connective ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              tissues diseases \(including systemic lupus erythematosus, rheumatoid ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              arthritis and Felty's syndrome\) may also have an autoantibody which ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              produces the "atypical P-ANCA" pattern. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Since the specificity of this autoantibody has not yet been ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              conclusively identified \(and there may be more than one specificity\), ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              there is no confirmatory test.  It is important to order this test only ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              in the clinical setting of inflammatory bowel or liver disease.  Note: ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Very rare patients with ulcerative colitis or primary sclerosing ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 434.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              cholangitis may have one of the vasculitis-related ANCA specificities ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              \(anti-MPO or PR3\). ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 405.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Titration of "UC-ANCA" is not performed as studies have found no ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 395.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              correlation between titer and disease activity.</pre> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 376.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Methodology  Immunofluorescence  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 366.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(               Analytic Time  3 days  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 357.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(            Testing Schedule  Daily - Batch analysis performed daily excluding  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 347.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              weekends and university holidays.  ) Tj
