(                              Absolute Minimum:  0.4 mL serum  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 635.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(         Rejection Criteria:  Specimens that are obtained from gel tubes.  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 626.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(             Reference Range  Venlafaxine + O-desmethylvenlafaxine: 195-400 ng/mL  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 616.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Order Form:  A-1a Miscellaneous Request or Epic Req  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 606.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  Venlafaxine is a serotonin and norepinephrine reuptake inhibitor \(SNRI\) ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 597.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              approved for treatment of major depression, anxiety and panic ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 587.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              disorders, and social phobias. It is also used for bipolar disorder, ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 578.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              bulimia, post-traumatic stress, obsessive behavior, and attention- ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 568.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              deficit disorder. Venlafaxine is converted by CYP2D6 to the active ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 558.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              metabolite, O-desmethylvenlafaxine. The therapeutic range for ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 549.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              venlafaxine includes measurement if O-desmethylvenlafaxine; optimal ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 539.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              response is seen when combined concentrations of parent and metabolite ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 530.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              are between 195 ng/mL to 400 ng/mL. Venlafaxine is significantly ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 520.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              affected by reduced hepatic function, but only slightly by reduced ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 510.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              renal function.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 501.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 491.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Average elimination half-lives are 5 hours for venlafaxine and 10 hours ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 482.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              for O-desmethylvenlafaxine, which are much shorter than many other ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 472.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              antidepressants. For this reason, extended release formulations are ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 462.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              available. Time to peak serum concentration is 2 hours for the regular ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 453.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              product and 8 hours for the extended release product. Common toxicities ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 443.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              are mild, including drowsiness, dizziness, nausea, and headache. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 424.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
