0.0000 Tw
(                    Comments  <strong>Draw sample following an overnight \(12 hour fast\).  Patient ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 318.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              should not consume alcohol for one day prior to blood ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 309.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              draw.</strong><br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 299.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 290.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Serum retinol is typically maintained until hepatic stores are almost ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 280.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              depleted. Values greater than 0.30 mg/L represent adequate liver ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 270.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              stores, whereas values less than 0.10 mg/L indicate deficiency. Samples ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 261.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              that come in contact with plastic tubing or have been exposed to ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 251.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              excessive light may show low results.<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 242.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 232.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Vitamin A toxicity occurs when retinol concentration exceeds the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 222.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              capacity of retinol binding protein \(RBP\).  Individuals with ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 213.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              compromised renal function can retain RBP and may, therefore, have ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 203.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              moderate retinol elevations. Drugs which interfere with vitamin A ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 194.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              analysis include probucol \(Lorelco\).<br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 184.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 174.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              This assay does not measure other vitamin A metabolites such as ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 165.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              retinaldehyde and retinoic acid. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 146.0 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                See Appendix  See Additional Information: <br /> ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 136.4 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Fasting Specimen Requirements<br />Specimens Requiring Immediate  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 126.8 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                              Delivery  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 117.2 Tm
0.0000 Tw
(                 Methodology  Quantitative High Performance Liquid Chromatography  ) Tj
1 0 0 1 102.0 107.6 Tm
0.0000 Tw
